  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GtapsfE.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Dv780sE.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7BSqZa9r3P\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1fCoHy.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/KxmischesDomi/MoreBannerFeatures/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GH0SZoc.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-banner-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/FOaR4sIZ?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-banner-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/FOaR4sIZ?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-banner-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_515000_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"Downloads\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/more-banner-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/515000.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"Versions\"></a> &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>实体旗帜：快乐的远古巨人、船、马、骡子、驴、炽足兽、村民</li>\n<li>玩家可将旗帜装备为：披风、帽子（支持槽位模组）</li>\n<li>结合胸甲和头盔与旗帜，可同时装备两者</li>\n<li>将旗帜悬挂在方块下方</li>\n<li>修复狐狸嘴中旗帜的位置</li>\n<li>旗帜线物品 <em>（与旗帜合成以增加最大层数限制）</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>测试版特性（必须在配置文件中启用）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>矿车旗帜</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Trinkets / Trinkets Canary</li>\n<li>Accessories</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>特性（v2.0 之前）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>将旗帜装备为披风（若安装了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a> 则使用披风槽位）</li>\n<li>通过新的背包槽位将旗帜放置在马、驴、骡子和羊驼身上</li>\n<li>右键点击猪、炽足兽、船和村民以放置旗帜</li>\n<li>使用剪刀从猪、炽足兽、船和村民身上移除旗帜</li>\n<li>将旗帜悬挂在方块下方</li>\n<li>修复狐狸嘴中旗帜的位置</li>\n<li>修复附魔旗帜上的附魔光效</li>\n<li>可通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a> 访问配置菜单</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>兼容性（v2.0 之前）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/boat-container\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boat Container</a> — 作者：KxmischesDomi</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waveycapes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wavey Capes</a> — 作者：tr9zw</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>不兼容项（v2.0 之前）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-banners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Banners</a> — 渲染异常</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glow-banners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glow Banners</a> — 旗帜无法发光</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://u.svrt.dev/u/edible-same-alaskanhusky.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://u.svrt.dev/u/calm-cavernous-barnowl.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://u.svrt.dev/u/eager-black-angwantibo.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://u.svrt.dev/u/raw-deadly-americanwigeon.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UEcEcL6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BInqA1P.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WCxzehM.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/As8JsDk.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0j1QtKa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
